   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Crypto_91010\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> Crypto_KeyExchangeCalcSecret <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Crypto_91010\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Crypto_91010]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CryptoDriver.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Crypto_91010\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CryptoDriver.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Crypto_91010, S. 58)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
