   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Calculates the shared secret key for the key exchange with the key material of the key identified by the crypto Key Id and the partner public key. The shared secret key is stored as a key element in the same key.</p></div>",
